# Modules to load at boot (/etc/init.d/S35modules).
#
# Deliberately empty. The generic OpenIPC overlay lists vfat and exfat for
# SD-card recording; mabur records nothing on the drone (the DVR lives on
# the ground station) and the exfat package is not built into this image, so modprobing
# it would only print an error at every boot. The vendor MI modules are not
# listed here either -- /etc/init.d/S70vendor insmods them via load_sigmastar.
